  "description": "After a night out with coworkers Soo-Hyeon meets his untimely death via car accident. Upset that he died a virgin, Soo-Hyeon curses his fate… only to be sent back to the land of the living as an incubus who must sleep with men. This complicates things when Soo-Hyeon’s awakening as an incubus leads to an intense encounter between him and Jin-Seong, his childhood friend and roommate. Amidst the confusion and physical intimacy, hidden feelings rise to the surface. What will the upcoming days hold for the both of them? \n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
